<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal sells marks at 100.30 esc/mark.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal sells marks at 100.30 esc/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal sold marks around 100.30 escudos per mark to brake a fall in the escudo, dealers said.  </p>
<p>&quot;The Bank of Portugal sold marks at 100.30 and also at higher levels,&quot; said one dealer.</p>
<p>&quot;The Bank of Portugal is not intervening at just one price, and is trying to keep the escudo under 100.30 per mark,&quot; said another.</p>
<p>Bank of Portugal spokesmen were not immediately available.</p>
<p>The escudo stood at 100.31/33 per mark at 1116 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
